# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The stock applications that the sweeps by taps did not reach, each opened by its identifier (lsreg -o: no page to
# find, and an alert left by the one before does not take the tap), looked at for 6 s, a tap where an alert's
# "Don't Allow" would be, then the home button. The host takes screenshots meanwhile.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 30 swipe 0.5 0.985 0.5 0.3 200 wait 8
/redwood/bin/lsreg -o com.apple.tv
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 7 tap 0.31 0.60 wait 3 button home wait 2
/redwood/bin/lsreg -o com.apple.iBooks
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 7 tap 0.31 0.60 wait 3 button home wait 2
